WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.840
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.380
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:10.040
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.780
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.450
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.360
=Episode 5=
=Miraculous Elixir=

02:05.300 --> 02:09.499
(Shou Yi, third-generation disciple of Shu Mountain)
Shou Huan, Yu'er, there are too many demon creatures.

02:09.500 --> 02:11.639
Today, I fear we may...

02:11.640 --> 02:14.779
(Wen Yu'er, third-generation disciple of Shu Mountain)
Yi. Do not say such disheartening things.

02:14.780 --> 02:15.899
Shou Yi.

02:15.900 --> 02:17.299
I will hold them off.

02:17.300 --> 02:18.939
(Shou Huan, third-generation disciple of Shu Mountain)
You take Yu'er and leave first.

02:18.940 --> 02:20.779
As a disciple of Shu Mountain,

02:20.780 --> 02:22.700
I will never flee from battle!

02:31.180 --> 02:32.620
Yu'er!

02:42.060 --> 02:42.979
It is Uncle Changqing.

02:42.980 --> 02:44.520
We are saved.

03:20.300 --> 03:21.780
Are you all right?

03:22.820 --> 03:25.259
- Greet Uncle Changqing
- Greet Uncle Changqing.

03:25.260 --> 03:27.859
Everyone, I have already
been cast out by Shu Mountain.

03:27.860 --> 03:28.899
Uncle Changqing,

03:28.900 --> 03:30.219
you will always be our uncle.

03:30.220 --> 03:30.779
Yes.

03:30.780 --> 03:33.499
Shou Yi. Has something happened
to the Demon-Sealing Pagoda?

03:33.500 --> 03:35.879
Otherwise, why would there be so many
demon creatures around Shu Mountain?

03:35.880 --> 03:37.859
You are exactly right.

03:37.860 --> 03:39.319
Not long after you left the mountain,

03:39.320 --> 03:40.959
the top of the Demon-Sealing Pagoda
was destroyed.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.379
Numerous demon creatures escaped.

03:42.380 --> 03:43.589
We suffered heavy casualties.

03:43.590 --> 03:45.539
No wonder demons
in the mortal realm have surged.

03:45.540 --> 03:47.049
What about the clan master?

03:47.050 --> 03:50.459
Clan Master Qing Wei and the elders have
already stabilized the Demon-Sealing Pagoda.

03:50.460 --> 03:54.019
Most of the remaining Shu Mountain disciples have also
gone down the mountain to subdue demons.

03:54.020 --> 03:55.499
We owe today entirely to you, Uncle.

03:55.500 --> 03:58.059
Otherwise, we likely would not
have made it back to Shu Mountain.

03:58.060 --> 03:59.219
Uncle Changqing.

03:59.220 --> 04:00.979
Come back with us.

04:00.980 --> 04:04.339
We will plead with the clan master together
and ask him to let you stay.

04:04.340 --> 04:08.659
At a time like this, when every hand is needed,
the clan master surely will not refuse.

04:08.660 --> 04:10.099
The sect has suffered
such a great calamity.

04:10.100 --> 04:12.059
Whether or not I may return to the sect,

04:12.060 --> 04:14.700
I will still devote myself to it.

04:15.340 --> 04:16.139
That is wonderful.

04:16.140 --> 04:17.580
This is great.

04:21.980 --> 04:23.940
You... Who are you?

04:23.980 --> 04:25.699
Why are you following us?

04:25.700 --> 04:28.380
I am your younger sister, Long Kui.

04:28.420 --> 04:29.299
You?

04:29.300 --> 04:31.019
Have you mistaken me for someone else?

04:31.020 --> 04:33.980
Even though
you look different from before,

04:34.020 --> 04:36.259
I would never mistake you.

04:36.260 --> 04:37.859
You are my brother,

04:37.860 --> 04:39.979
Long Yang,
Crown Prince of Jiang Kingdom.

04:39.980 --> 04:43.299
I have waited for you
inside this sword for a thousand years.

04:43.300 --> 04:45.459
Yang, do you not remember Kui?

04:45.460 --> 04:48.419
How could I possibly remember something
from a thousand years ago?

04:48.420 --> 04:49.659
Wait.

04:49.660 --> 04:52.219
You said you live inside the sword.

04:52.220 --> 04:53.499
Could it be

04:53.500 --> 04:55.100
are you a Sword Immortal?

04:55.300 --> 04:56.659
A Sword Immortal?

04:56.660 --> 04:57.899
Do not waste words with her.

04:57.900 --> 05:01.260
We still have to go to the Thunder Hall headquarters
to settle accounts with Luo Rulie.

05:01.780 --> 05:02.819
That is right.

05:02.820 --> 05:05.019
We must reach Jiuding Mountain
before nightfall.

05:05.020 --> 05:07.240
Otherwise, we will be sleeping
in the wilderness again.

05:07.240 --> 05:08.499
Reach it before nightfall?

05:08.500 --> 05:10.260
I have a way.

05:11.540 --> 05:13.699
How can your demeanor
change so suddenly?

05:13.700 --> 05:14.939
What way could you possibly have?

05:14.940 --> 05:16.179
Lad.

05:16.180 --> 05:17.619
(Long Kui, Red)
Who is she?

05:17.620 --> 05:19.659
Judging by how she looks,

05:19.660 --> 05:21.460
is she your maid?

05:21.940 --> 05:24.139
- Who are you calling a maid?
- She is my young lady.

05:24.140 --> 05:25.459
I am the maid.

05:25.460 --> 05:26.339
Bah.

05:26.340 --> 05:27.859
I am a follower.

05:27.860 --> 05:29.480
You still have not said
what your plan is.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.719
This Demon Sword
was forged by Crown Prince Long Yang

05:31.720 --> 05:33.779
according to an ancient manual.

05:33.780 --> 05:37.500
As long as the inscription is recited,
one can ride the sword and fly.

05:37.540 --> 05:39.379
From high above,

05:39.380 --> 05:41.859
whether it is Jiuding Mountain
or Shiding Mountain,

05:41.860 --> 05:44.059
we can arrive in the blink of an eye.

05:44.060 --> 05:45.299
How do you recite it? Quickly.

05:45.300 --> 05:46.820
Teach me now.

05:52.540 --> 05:54.660
I... I will try.

05:56.980 --> 05:59.659
Heavenly spirits, earthly spirits,

05:59.660 --> 06:02.499
my little sister
is the one I cherish most.

06:02.500 --> 06:03.899
What kind of nonsense is that?

06:03.900 --> 06:05.379
Are you mocking us?

06:05.380 --> 06:06.659
Unite sword and qi,

06:06.660 --> 06:09.540
ride the sword and soar. Rise.

06:11.020 --> 06:12.540
It worked.

06:13.140 --> 06:14.859
The sword really flew.

06:14.860 --> 06:16.820
Not bad, lad.

06:22.300 --> 06:25.019
With this, even carrying one person
is difficult.

06:25.020 --> 06:26.700
How are we supposed
to fly over the mountains?

06:27.420 --> 06:30.180
Taking along ten or even more
would be no trouble at all.

06:32.340 --> 06:33.700
Jing Tian.

06:35.340 --> 06:37.020
Get on.

06:45.100 --> 06:48.060
I am flying!

07:25.340 --> 07:28.000
Xuejian. There is a city over there.
Let us go and ask around.

07:28.000 --> 07:28.720
Mm.

07:35.680 --> 07:38.279
(Jiuding Mountain, Deyang City)

07:38.280 --> 07:41.160
(Deyang)

07:41.540 --> 07:43.900
Why is this city so desolate?

07:44.580 --> 07:47.820
Why do the people here all look
as if they have lost their souls?

07:49.500 --> 07:51.819
That person over there
seems more normal.

07:51.820 --> 07:53.300
I will go ask him.

07:54.300 --> 07:55.419
Sir.

07:55.420 --> 07:57.860
May I ask if you know Thunder Hall...

07:59.940 --> 08:02.260
He... What is wrong with him?

08:04.580 --> 08:06.139
The aura on them

08:06.140 --> 08:08.060
does not seem human.

08:09.380 --> 08:11.060
Jing Tian, look.

08:15.980 --> 08:17.059
Little one.

08:17.060 --> 08:18.099
What are you doing?

08:18.100 --> 08:19.980
Sister, have some too.

08:21.660 --> 08:23.100
I have some here.

08:23.780 --> 08:25.179
Little one.

08:25.180 --> 08:26.860
Have this flatbread.

08:31.740 --> 08:35.300
Mother said we cannot take
other people's things for nothing.

08:35.340 --> 08:36.899
Er Ya's cloth doll,

08:36.900 --> 08:38.540
I will give it to you.

08:38.620 --> 08:39.979
No need.

08:39.980 --> 08:42.539
I cannot take Er Ya's cloth doll.

08:42.540 --> 08:44.539
Then I cannot take the flatbread either.

08:44.540 --> 08:46.060
Here you go.

08:46.140 --> 08:47.779
Such a cute cloth doll.

08:47.780 --> 08:49.620
Can you give it to me?

08:54.740 --> 08:55.659
Little one.

08:55.660 --> 08:57.180
Eat slowly.

08:57.620 --> 08:58.859
Little one.

08:58.860 --> 09:00.819
Do you know why the people in this city

09:00.820 --> 09:02.859
have all become so strange?

09:02.860 --> 09:05.059
Everyone cannot afford food anymore.

09:05.060 --> 09:07.059
But after they eat elixir,

09:07.060 --> 09:09.379
they do not need to eat food at all.

09:09.380 --> 09:10.189
Elixir?

09:10.190 --> 09:13.899
Hall Master Luo, elixir... Save me.

09:13.900 --> 09:15.259
Mm.

09:15.260 --> 09:19.139
If you eat too much elixir,
you will turn into this strange state.

09:19.140 --> 09:21.819
Mother was afraid I
would become like that too.

09:21.820 --> 09:24.379
So she gave all the other food to me,

09:24.380 --> 09:26.739
and went to eat elixir herself.

09:26.740 --> 09:28.299
Such a fragrant flatbread.

09:28.300 --> 09:29.939
Why did you not finish it?

09:29.940 --> 09:32.340
I saved half for Mother.

09:32.500 --> 09:34.739
She went to receive elixir yesterday,

09:34.740 --> 09:37.340
and has not come back yet.

09:38.620 --> 09:39.579
Do you know

09:39.580 --> 09:41.659
where everyone goes to receive elixir?

09:41.660 --> 09:42.459
Over there.

09:42.460 --> 09:44.680
(Hongde Inn)

09:47.220 --> 09:50.080
Strange, where is everyone?

09:51.540 --> 09:52.980
This way.

10:10.220 --> 10:12.140
That is Thunder Hall's mark.

10:15.740 --> 10:18.780
- There does not seem to be anyone below.
- Let us go down and take a look.

10:29.220 --> 10:30.900
Proceed with care.

10:44.140 --> 10:45.580
That was close.

10:46.220 --> 10:47.780
Hurry up, get up here.

10:48.860 --> 10:55.420
Immortal Master, bless us.

10:55.940 --> 11:00.780
Please bestow the elixir.

11:04.100 --> 11:09.780
Immortal Master, bless us.

11:10.700 --> 11:13.020
Move faster. Do not slack off.

11:15.020 --> 11:17.780
Please bless me, Immortal Master.

11:19.120 --> 11:19.739
Mm.

11:19.740 --> 11:21.539
You did well today.

11:21.540 --> 11:22.099
Here.

11:22.100 --> 11:22.739
Good.

11:22.740 --> 11:24.100
Thank you.

11:24.140 --> 11:25.780
Remember this well.

11:25.860 --> 11:28.000
As long as you
take the elixir regularly,

11:28.000 --> 11:29.699
you will all comprehend the Dao
and ascend as immortals.

11:29.700 --> 11:30.659
Yes.

11:30.660 --> 11:32.139
Thank you, Hall Master Luo.

11:32.140 --> 11:32.819
This is great.

11:32.820 --> 11:33.499
This is great.

11:33.500 --> 11:35.379
It will be our turn soon.

11:35.380 --> 11:37.100
Next.

11:37.340 --> 11:38.259
Take it.

11:38.260 --> 11:38.939
Thank you.

11:38.940 --> 11:40.300
Thank you.

11:42.420 --> 11:43.819
Your work hours are not enough.

11:43.820 --> 11:44.939
No elixir for you.

11:44.940 --> 11:46.660
Go on, go.

11:47.300 --> 11:50.419
Ever since the Immortal arrived,
life here has been completely different.

11:50.420 --> 11:52.100
Of course.

11:52.700 --> 11:54.099
Someone is guarding this area.

11:54.100 --> 11:55.460
What should we do?

11:59.340 --> 12:01.860
Wow, impressive.

12:05.260 --> 12:07.460
What is that thing?

12:17.340 --> 12:18.419
They are all unconscious.

12:18.420 --> 12:20.300
Hua Ying is amazing.

12:24.100 --> 12:25.659
You have worked hard.

12:25.660 --> 12:27.380
Come back and rest now.

12:28.580 --> 12:30.020
Let us go.

12:30.820 --> 12:32.979
Today the Hall Master is in seclusion.

12:32.980 --> 12:34.499
We can relax a bit.

12:34.500 --> 12:35.699
But keep your voices down.

12:35.700 --> 12:38.220
If you wake the Hall Master,
it will be trouble.

12:42.140 --> 12:43.980
Who are you people?

12:46.820 --> 12:48.420
This is bad.

12:50.220 --> 12:51.019
Wake up.

12:51.020 --> 12:51.739
Wake up.

12:51.740 --> 12:52.659
Catch them.

12:52.660 --> 12:54.179
How did they get in here?

12:54.180 --> 12:55.620
Grab them now.

12:57.180 --> 12:58.700
Hurry.

13:01.940 --> 13:03.900
Do not run. Stop right there.

13:04.020 --> 13:05.139
They are over there.

13:05.140 --> 13:07.140
Quickly. This way.

13:07.420 --> 13:09.980
Why are these fools
making such a racket?

13:10.620 --> 13:11.339
Do not run.

13:11.340 --> 13:12.740
Stop.

13:12.830 --> 13:14.179
Hm?

13:14.180 --> 13:15.980
What is going on?

13:17.460 --> 13:20.780
So the missing villagers
are all here doing hard labor.

13:24.820 --> 13:25.499
You go that way.

13:25.500 --> 13:27.100
I will chase this way.

13:45.780 --> 13:47.100
Zi Xuan.

13:55.340 --> 13:57.180
Tian.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.739
Quickly.

13:58.740 --> 14:00.099
Zi Xuan.

14:00.100 --> 14:01.099
Why are you here?

14:01.100 --> 14:03.539
I came to investigate
the demonized Thunder Hall disciples,

14:03.540 --> 14:04.579
but unexpectedly

14:04.580 --> 14:06.939
I was trapped
by Luo Rulie's Immortal Binding Rope.

14:06.940 --> 14:08.860
How did you end up here?

14:09.660 --> 14:11.459
Thunder Hall
has committed countless evils.

14:11.460 --> 14:13.540
We tracked the matter all the way here.

14:14.020 --> 14:15.059
This... This rope...

14:15.060 --> 14:16.099
It is useless.

14:16.100 --> 14:17.339
This is a Taoist artifact.

14:17.340 --> 14:19.860
Neither water nor fire can harm it,
nor blades or weapons break it.

14:20.500 --> 14:22.139
It really cannot be undone.

14:22.140 --> 14:24.700
You can cut it with the Demon Sword.

14:26.980 --> 14:28.379
How could a Taoist artifact

14:28.380 --> 14:30.340
ever compare to the Demon Sword?

14:30.580 --> 14:32.020
I will try.

14:36.500 --> 14:37.699
That is great.

14:37.700 --> 14:39.300
It really works.

14:42.940 --> 14:44.289
Tian.

14:44.290 --> 14:45.739
And this young lady is...

14:45.740 --> 14:47.539
I am Kui.

14:47.540 --> 14:49.579
We will explain later.
Let us get out of here first.

14:49.580 --> 14:50.019
All right.

14:50.020 --> 14:53.169
I saw many people of Deyang being deceived
by the elixir and brought here.

14:53.170 --> 14:54.499
We should find a way to save them.

14:54.500 --> 14:55.830
- Yes.
- Yes.

15:00.220 --> 15:02.060
It is them.

15:02.460 --> 15:03.819
I have been down there.

15:03.820 --> 15:05.139
It is a ritual altar.

15:05.140 --> 15:06.580
Good.

15:09.420 --> 15:11.260
They got away again.

15:11.700 --> 15:13.180
Thank you.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.419
Reckless fools
who defile the sacred ground.

15:22.420 --> 15:23.860
Kill him.

15:26.020 --> 15:27.059
All of you, attack.

15:27.060 --> 15:28.540
Kill them.

15:37.060 --> 15:38.939
They are all ordinary civilians.
What do we do?

15:38.940 --> 15:40.299
We cannot hurt them.

15:40.300 --> 15:41.739
Let us fall back first.

15:41.740 --> 15:42.659
I will hold them off.

15:42.660 --> 15:44.220
Fall back into the cave.

15:52.220 --> 15:54.510
Stop. Do not run.

15:58.940 --> 16:00.219
Quick.

16:00.220 --> 16:01.659
Stop.

16:01.660 --> 16:03.499
That is where the Hall Master
is in seclusion.

16:03.500 --> 16:05.379
We should not risk offending him.

16:05.380 --> 16:07.339
Let those people fend for themselves.

16:07.340 --> 16:08.780
Fall back.

16:25.180 --> 16:28.460
Something is off here. Stay alert.

16:52.020 --> 16:54.260
You again.

16:54.940 --> 16:56.580
Luo Rulie?

16:57.020 --> 16:58.059
Be careful.

16:58.060 --> 17:01.099
It is him. He turned into a demon
and caused my grandpa's death.

17:01.100 --> 17:02.499
You cast aside your humanity

17:02.500 --> 17:04.259
and willingly became a demon.

17:04.260 --> 17:06.979
Someone like you should
never command such wicked arts.

17:06.980 --> 17:08.820
Who is backing you?

17:10.240 --> 17:13.319
I had planned to let you
live a few more days.

17:13.320 --> 17:16.159
But it seems you are eager to die.

17:16.160 --> 17:19.090
Then I will grant your wish.

18:17.740 --> 18:19.979
Tian. He is draining
Xuejian's spiritual power.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.580
Xuejian.

18:29.680 --> 18:32.840
(Roaring Blade Gale)

18:41.510 --> 18:41.979
Xuejian.

18:41.980 --> 18:43.060
Xuejian.

18:48.820 --> 18:50.219
Immortal Master.

18:50.220 --> 18:51.499
Save me.

18:51.500 --> 18:52.939
Luo Rulie.

18:52.940 --> 18:54.419
You have reached a dead end,

18:54.420 --> 18:55.940
yet you still refuse to yield.

18:56.350 --> 18:58.710
Save me...

19:13.020 --> 19:14.700
Clan Master Qing Wei?

19:18.820 --> 19:20.099
Unite sword and qi,

19:20.100 --> 19:21.819
ride the sword and soar.

19:21.820 --> 19:23.060
Rise.

19:24.260 --> 19:25.820
It worked.

19:26.500 --> 19:27.980
Jing Tian!

19:48.860 --> 19:52.139
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

19:52.140 --> 19:55.459
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

19:55.460 --> 19:59.139
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

19:59.140 --> 20:02.339
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:02.340 --> 20:05.499
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:05.500 --> 20:09.179
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

20:09.180 --> 20:12.899
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

20:12.900 --> 20:19.379
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

20:19.380 --> 20:22.859
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

20:22.860 --> 20:26.339
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

20:26.340 --> 20:29.739
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

20:29.740 --> 20:33.139
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

20:33.140 --> 20:36.499
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

20:36.500 --> 20:40.019
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

20:40.020 --> 20:43.379
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

20:43.380 --> 20:46.699
♪All for the sake of the living♪

20:46.700 --> 20:51.820
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:06.320 --> 21:10.139
(Next episode preview)

21:10.140 --> 21:11.900
And who might you be?

21:12.020 --> 21:14.020
You are not worthy of knowing.

21:24.340 --> 21:25.780
A ghost!

21:26.300 --> 21:27.899
You are a sword spirit,

21:27.900 --> 21:29.500
and you are afraid of that?

21:29.620 --> 21:30.819
That is true.

21:30.820 --> 21:34.220
What brings you outsiders here?
